        <body>
            <div xml:id="d77">

                <pb facs="0188" n="100" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg100"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr. Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-03-29"><hi rendition="#italic">March 29, 1892</hi></date>.
                        (Received May 13.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1501.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch No. 1495, March 22
                    last, wherein I inform you that I will forward to you a copy of an identic note
                    sent by the foreign representatives to the Yamên on the likin questions that
                    have arisen at Canton, I have now the honor to inclose a copy of said identic
                    note.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Denby.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d77-a1.xml" xpointer="d77-a1"/>
            </div>
